<title>USA: TABLE- Kaiser Q2 net shr $0.16 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Kaiser Q2 net shr $0.16 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.16		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			   13.7			8.2</p>
<p> Revs			 597.1		    567.6</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    71.8		     71.9</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net			   16.3		     18.1</p>
<p> Revs		     1,144.5		  1,098.7</p>
<p> Avg			   71.8		     71.9</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The Q2 1997 earnings include the following non-recurring items: a pre-tax restructuring charge of 19.7 million, or $0.17 a share, and a tax provision benefit of $12.5 million, or $0.177a share. The company's full name is Kaiser Aluminum Corp.</p>
